    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Anji \u3010Implication\u3011</h2>- Stimulation that gives the mind, unconsciously, certain notions.<br>This game is a horror walking simulator where you just go down the stairs.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2>You are about to go home after working overtime.<br><br>However, the building's elevators are not in operation.<br><br>and you have to go down the emergency stairs from the top floor to get home...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Playthrough Time</h2>15 ~ 20 minute<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2>\u30fb16:18 vertical play screen<br>\u3000Vertical play screens look similar to smartphone screens.<br>\u3000On a normal 16:9 display, black bars appear at both ends of the screen.<br><br>\u30fbPhotorealistic visual effects created with Unreal Engine 5<br>\u3000Viewing angle, depth of field, etc.<br>\u3000Visual effects are represented as close as possible to the way the human eye sees.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759770/extras/1f5ecb921f60346fc0ac1beea2d1fad9.poster.avif?t=1722775216\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759770/extras/1f5ecb921f60346fc0ac1beea2d1fad9.webm?t=1722775216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759770/extras/1f5ecb921f60346fc0ac1beea2d1fad9.mp4?t=1722775216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uploading and livestreaming Guidelines</h2>Please adhere to the following guidelines when posting or livestreaming game footage:<br><br>-Include the game's name in the title of the video or livestream.<br>-Include the store page URL in the summary or description section of the video or livestream.<br>-Some of the submitted videos and live streaming footage may be used on the Bunbukuzu Youtube channel.<br>-Posting or livestreaming content limited to paid members, such as YouTube memberships, is not permitted.<br>-Bunbukuzu will not be held responsible for any damages incurred by the publisher or any third party resulting from the posting or livestreaming of videos.<br>-Please note that these guidelines are subject to change without prior notice.",
